# Accessibility (a11y)

## Semantic HTML

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD: Semantic elements
<header>...</header>
<nav>...</nav>
<main>...</main>
<article>...</article>
<aside>...</aside>
<footer>...</footer>

// ❌ BAD: Divs for everything
<div className="header">...</div>
```

## Buttons vs Links

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD: Button for actions
<button onClick={handleSubmit}>Submit</button>

// ✅ GOOD: Link for navigation
<a href="/professionals">View professionals</a>

// ❌ BAD: Div as button
<div onClick={handleClick}>Click here</div>

// ❌ BAD: Button to navigate
<button onClick={() => navigate('/home')}>Go to home</button>
```

## Form Labels

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD: Associated label
<label htmlFor="email">Email</label>
<input id="email" type="email" />

// ✅ GOOD: Wrapping label
<label>
  Email
  <input type="email" />
</label>

// ❌ BAD: No label
<input type="email" placeholder="Email" />
```

## ARIA When Necessary

```tsx
// ✅ Loading states
<button aria-busy={isLoading} disabled={isLoading}>
  {isLoading ? 'Loading...' : 'Submit'}
</button>

// ✅ Expandable elements
<button 
  aria-expanded={isOpen}
  aria-controls="menu-content"
>
  Menu
</button>
<div id="menu-content" hidden={!isOpen}>...</div>

// ✅ Form errors
<input 
  aria-invalid={!!error}
  aria-describedby={error ? 'email-error' : undefined}
/>
{error && <span id="email-error" role="alert">{error}</span>}
```

## Images

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD: Descriptive alt
<img src={doctor.photo} alt={`Photo of ${doctor.name}`} />

// ✅ GOOD: Decorative (empty alt)
<img src="/pattern.svg" alt="" role="presentation" />

// ❌ BAD: No alt
<img src={photo} />

// ❌ BAD: Redundant alt
<img src={photo} alt="image" />
```

## Visible Focus

```tsx
// ✅ Keep focus visible for keyboard navigation
<button className="
  focus:outline-none 
  focus-visible:ring-2 
  focus-visible:ring-primary 
  focus-visible:ring-offset-2
">

// Tailwind already includes this in shadcn/ui by default
```

## Skip Links

```tsx
// For keyboard navigation
function Layout({ children }) {
  return (
    <>
      <a 
        href="#main-content" 
        className="sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:absolute focus:p-4 focus:bg-background"
      >
        Skip to main content
      </a>
      <Header />
      <main id="main-content">{children}</main>
    </>
  );
}
```

## Color and Contrast

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD: Don't rely solely on color
<span className="text-destructive flex items-center gap-1">
  <AlertIcon /> Error: field required
</span>

// ❌ BAD: Only color indicates state
<span className="text-red-500">Error</span>
```

## Touch Targets (Mobile)

```tsx
// ✅ Touch areas minimum 44x44px
<button className="min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px] p-3">
<a className="inline-flex items-center p-3">
```
